On Mar 31, 2:50 am, Olivier <O...@nowhere.wd> wrote:
>   -- how to keep it happy ?

You can't increase it's tameness by feeding it since since L's don't
eat. You just have to make sure you keep it on the same dungeon level
as you as much as possible so that it's tameness doesn't decrease. If
you can cast charm monster or have a ?oTaming then you might be able
to tame the L again that way if it does go feral.

>   -- what will happen when I will genocide L's?

I'm not sure, but you might suffer from the -15 to alignment "killing
pet" penalty. Alignment penalties are generally not a problem unless
you just went on a major killing spree of peacefuls. If so, go kill a
bunch of monsters to get your alignment up. If you have a wand or
potion of enlightenment you can find out (roughly) what you're
alignment is.

